# Web3Forms access key — a public alias for the destination inbox, not a secret.
# It ships in the HTML by design; it only ever forwards to the address it was
# registered with, which is why that address stays out of the markup.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com (250 submissions/month).
#
# Leave this unset and the contact section renders without the form card.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
